</section>

<section class="section container" aria-labelledby="directions-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / The questions that connect it</p><h2 id="directions-title">Perceive. Represent.<br>Support decisions.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Three connected research directions. Distinct projects, shared questions about reliable robotic perception.</p></div>
  <div class="directions-grid">
    <article><span class="direction-number">01</span><h3>Real-time <br>perception</h3><p>How can a robot understand what it sees, consistently over time and across sensing modalities?</p><a href="/publications/ssp.html">Video perception / SSP <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="direction-number">02</span><h3>3D scene <br>understanding</h3><p>How can semantic geometry become a more reliable representation of the world?</p><a href="/publications/voxelfix.html">Semantic mapping / VoxelFix <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article><span class="direction-number">03</span><h3>Aerial <br>autonomy</h3><p>How can perception support planning, and how should we evaluate an agent’s complete mission?</p><a href="/publications/missionbench.html">Mission evaluation / MissionBench <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="lab-section dark-section" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
  <div class="container lab-grid">
    <div class="lab-copy"><p class="eyebrow">05 / Look beyond the figure</p><h2 id="lab-title">Same world.<br>A clearer map.</h2><p>Explore what changes when semantic labels are corrected, while the underlying geometry stays fixed.</p><p>The VoxelFix viewer places input, corrected, and ground-truth maps side by side, with synchronized cameras and real scene data.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/publications/voxelfix.html#viewer">Explore the voxel maps <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="lab-note">Interactive 3D opens on the project page.</span></div>
    <figure class="lab-figure">{{ media('voxel-detail', 'Published VoxelFix comparison of input, corrected and ground-truth semantic maps, with the original method labels preserved.') }}<figcaption>VoxelFix · published qualitative comparison · <a href="/publications/voxelfix.html#id-qualitative-caption">Figure & experimental context ↗</a></figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container applied-preview" aria-labelledby="applied-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">06 / Beyond the paper</p><div class="applied-grid"><h2 id="applied-title">Research meets<br>real systems.</h2><div><p class="large-copy">My work sits at the intersection of computer vision, semantic mapping, and aerial robotics.</p><p>At Fraunhofer IVI, I work in a collaborative research environment where robotic perception connects with practical autonomous systems.</p><a class="text-link" href="/work.html">Applied research context <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
</section>

